Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/tudfilmsoc/', 'Clapperboard', 'sky', 'Film Festival Trips · Film Screenings · Quiz nights · Film Production Workshops · Guest Speakers · Competitions and Prizes', 'City', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/IMG_0037_1770118990_th.jpeg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/IMG_5596_1770119070_th.jpeg', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzA4Mg==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/filmsocietycitycampus', 'film@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudfilmsoc/", "label": null}, {"kind": "whatsapp", "url": "https://chat.whatsapp.com/BJbYlhGCmqZ8rxEUoKwWQS", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "History", "body": "Once dissolved from the Covid 19 Pandemic, the Film Society was revived by Film and Broadcasting students in 2023, and since its revival, it has consistently been in the Top 3 biggest societies in all of TU Dublin.\n\nIn calendar year 25/26, we were the second biggest society in the entire university, missing out by just 5 members."}, {"title": "Achievements", "body": "Best Departmental (2020)\n\nBiggest Growth Award (2026)"}, {"title": "Meetings", "body": "Film Festival Trips\n\nFilm Screenings\n\nQuiz nights\n\nFilm Production Workshops\n\nGuest Speakers\n\nCompetitions and Prizes"}]'::jsonb, '3082', '2026-10-10T16:06:25Z', '["Arts"]'::jsonb),
  ('filo-society-city-campus', 'Filo Society (City Campus)', 'Filo Society', 'Arts/Cultural/Languages', 'FiloSoc is a vibrant college society that celebrates and shares Filipino culture, embodying the spirit of "It''s more fun in the…', 'FiloSoc is a vibrant college society that celebrates and shares Filipino culture, embodying the spirit of "It''s more fun in the Philippines." FiloSoc brings laughter, fun, and a sense of community to campus life through exciting events, cultural showcases, and social gatherings. The society fosters close-knit friendships ("barkadas") where members come together to enjoy Filipino traditions, cuisine, music, and more while creating lasting bonds in a warm and welcoming environment.
MABUHAY !', 'Globe2', 'coral', '', 'City', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/FILOSOCLOGO_1726785665_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/56368061275b8afb0ac37a852e05958f_1726787230_th.jpg', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzIzNQ==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/filosocietycitycampus', 'filosoc@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudfilosoc/", "label": null}, {"kind": "tiktok", "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@tudfilosoc", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "History", "body": "FiloSoc was founded in 2022 by a close group of friends who wanted to bring Filipino culture to life on campus. With a passion for their heritage, they set out to create a space where students could experience the vibrant traditions, food, and values of the Philippines. Since then, FiloSoc has grown into a dynamic community, promoting Filipino identity through fun events, cultural celebrations, and social gatherings. True to the spirit of \"It''s more fun in the Philippines,\" the society fosters lasting friendships and a strong sense of belonging."}]'::jsonb, '3235', '2026-10-10T16:06:24Z', '["Culture"]'::jsonb),
  ('formula-student-society-tallaght-campus', 'Formula Student Society (Tallaght Campus)', 'Formula Student Society', 'Academic/Course Related', 'A society for all motorsport lovers!!', 'A society for all motorsport lovers!!

WHO ARE WE?

Formula Student is a dynamic community where motorsport enthusiasts unite to share their passion for cars and racing with like-minded individuals. This society is open to all students, regardless of their academic discipline. Whether you are pursuing engineering or any other field of study, you are welcome to join and contribute in various capacities.

OUR GOALS:

• Building our community of motorsport enthusiasts and connecting with other societies.

• Developing our car for the IMECHE Formula Student competition that will take place in Silverstone, UK in summer of 2025.

• Hosting multiple days out and events throughout the academic year.', 'Cog', 'sky', 'All meetings will be held in Tallaght Campus or via Discord.', 'Tallaght', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/Logo_1698531278_th.png', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/fa9c22ea-22dd-4e20-b271-5e5af39ba6a4_1722360270_th.JPG', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzIyNQ==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/formulastudentsocietytallaghtcampus', 'formulastudent@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://instagram.com/tudformulastudenttc", "label": null}, {"kind": "tiktok", "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@formulastudent", "label": null}, {"kind": "linktree", "url": "https://linktr.ee/TUDFormulaStudentTC", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "History", "body": "Formula student society was founded in 2022 with the aim of bringing together students with similar interests in motorsport and the automotive world."}, {"title": "Achievements", "body": "Competing in Concept class at IMECHE Formula Student UK in 2023 and 2024\n\nBICS Best New Society 2023"}, {"title": "Meetings", "body": "All meetings will be held in Tallaght Campus or via Discord. Dates and times will be announced through our Instagram page and Discord server."}]'::jsonb, '3225', '2026-10-10T16:06:22Z', '["Science", "Technology"]'::jsonb),
  ('gaisce-student-network', 'Gaisce Student Network', 'Gaisce Student Network', 'Volunteering/Civic/Charity', 'Interested in starting or continuing your Gaisce journey?! Want to find a PAL at TU Dublin? Join up with the TU Dublin Gaisce community...', 'Interested in starting or continuing your Gaisce journey?!
