Share you achievements!', 'HeartHandshake', 'teal', '', null, 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/GaisceStudentNetworkSticker_1789730517_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/Gaiscelogo_1747333385_th.jpg', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzIwMQ==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/gaiscenetwork', 'claire.flannery@tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudublingaiscesoc/", "label": null}, {"kind": "facebook", "url": "https://www.facebook.com/TuDublinGaisceSoc", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '3201', '2026-10-10T16:06:21Z', '["Volunteering"]'::jsonb),
