Whether you develop games yourself, are interested in game development, or just want to tag-along, you are more than welcome here ^_^ !', 'Code2', 'indigo', '', null, 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/saddog-3_upscaled_1725554553_th.png', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/GDS_Logo_BlackBig_whitefill_1760042585_th.png', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzI1OA==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/gamedevsociety', 'gamedev@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudublin_gamedevsoc/", "label": null}, {"kind": "discord", "url": "https://discord.gg/nh9FZfatAD", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "History", "body": "29/05/1453"}]'::jsonb, '3258', '2026-10-10T16:06:19Z', '["Technology", "Gaming"]'::jsonb),
  ('games-society-city-campus', 'Games Society (City Campus)', 'Games Society', 'Gaming/Technology', 'The home of all things nerdy on City Campus - Including boardgames, videogames, Dungeons & Dragons, Warhammer, Magic: The Gathering and…', 'The home of all things nerdy on City Campus - Including boardgames, videogames, Dungeons & Dragons, Warhammer, Magic: The Gathering and everything in between and beyond! - Join our Discord to learn more

Welcome to TU Dublin''s Games Society!

Hey there! We do all kinds of gaming, from Super Mario Kart, to Dungeons & Dragons, to Secret Hitler! We''re one of the oldest societies around, but we still keep it fresh with our events and games! Whether you''re a life long aficionado of all things gaming, want to try something new out or just wanna make some super cool friends, be sure to jump into any of our events and check out our discord!

Video Games

We usually run video game nights weekly, and we''re more than happy to take requests & suggestions! Outside of this, we have a ton of channels on our discord where you can reach out and find someone to play with, whether it''s League of Legends or Grand Theft Auto.

Minecraft

We have our own active and super welcoming Minecraft server where you can hop on and build with some great people, or strike out on your own in an isolated corner of the map!

TTRPGs

We have a huge role playing community, with over 90 people taking part in our D&D campaign last year. We usually run a year long campaign, with different dungeon masters creating their own worlds and players creating characters to level up and develop throughout the year. Between these arcs, we have one shot weeks, where you can try out different RPG systems and/or give being a game master a try!

Card Games

We have a super passionate group of Magic the Gathering players, whether it''s in person or on Arena, you can almost always find someone to play a game with! Usually we run Sealed Leagues & Drafts, although Commander is also hugely popular around here. We even have a few Yu-Gi-Oh! fans too!

You can view our constitution here!', 'Gamepad2', 'indigo', '', 'City', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/general_logo4_1662833180_th.png', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/Newtempbanner_1727363305_th.png', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzA4NA==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/gamessocietycitycampus', 'games@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudublin_gamesoc/", "label": null}, {"kind": "x", "url": "https://twitter.com/TUDublinGameSoc", "label": null}, {"kind": "discord", "url": "https://www.discord.gg/9JurTcH", "label": null}, {"kind": "linktree", "url": "https://linktr.ee/tudublingamesoc", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "History", "body": "We have been participating in a charity event called Gaming for Good for the past 2 years with Dublin Simon Community - last year we raised €1700 (it was actually €1696.96 XD)"}, {"title": "Achievements", "body": "We won the following awards last year (2021/2022):\n\n• Best Online Presence\n\n• Best Publicity Campaign\n\n• Best Charity Event\n\n• Best Out of Context photo\n\n• Best Poster\n\n• Best Livestream moment\n\n• Best Online Event\n\n• Best Society (cultural/academic/social)\n\n• Best Fresher (our boy Andrew who''s in charge of VBG)"}]'::jsonb, '3084', '2026-10-10T16:06:18Z', '["Gaming"]'::jsonb),
  ('green-volunteering-group', 'Green Volunteering Group', 'Green Volunteering Group', 'Volunteering/Civic/Charity', 'As part of a new pilot programme of ''TU Dublin Student Networks'' who receive funding for activities on campus, we are setting up a Green…', 'As part of a new pilot programme of ''TU Dublin Student Networks'' who receive funding for activities on campus, we are setting up a Green Volunteering Group for the academic year 2026-27.

This group is open to all TU Dublin Students across all campuses and the idea is to bring like minded students who are interested and engaged in sustainable/ green/ environmentalism related activity to run socials and activities on campus together.

The aim is to support students to come together in real life and to contribute to campus vibrancy.

The Green Volunteering Group will work in collaboration with TU Dublin''s Green Campus Network, An Taisce Climate Ambassadors and programme, as well as TU Dublin Societies and the Students'' Union officers and groups engaged in related activity.', 'Leaf', 'teal', '', null, 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/GreenVolunteeringGroup-StudentNetworkStickerRectangleStickerLandscape_1789731230_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/GreenVolunteeringGroup-StudentNetworkStickerRectangleStickerLandscape_1789731236_th.jpg', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzI3Nw==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/greenvolunteeringgroup', null, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '3277', '2026-10-10T16:06:17Z', '["Volunteering", "Outdoors"]'::jsonb),
  ('horror-society-city-campus', 'Horror Society (City Campus)', 'Horror Society', 'Special Interest/Social', 'We love all things horror and aim to deliver a fresh, scary and fun experience to all our members year round!', 'We love all things horror and aim to deliver a fresh, scary and fun experience to all our members year round! October is our busiest month but catch our regular movie screenings, cinema trips, & social events outside then too.
Join us on Discord or Instagram to stay up-to-date on all things Horror Soc
We love all things horror and aim to deliver a fresh, scary and fun experience to all our members year round! October is our busiest month but catch our regular movie screenings, cinema trips, & social events outside then too.

The line-up of events this year includes regular on-campus movie screenings in Grangegorman, a séance evening in Aungier St, coffee mornings, cinema trips, Slaughterhouse @ The Complex trips, and some special events. Keep in touch by registering & receiving society email newsletters or through following our Instagram. Join us on Discord for discussions of all things horror; literature, gaming, and film.', 'Clapperboard', 'emerald', '', 'City', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/horrorsoclogoalt_1695404227_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/Horror_Soc_1666475680_th.jpg', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzIyOQ==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/horrorsociety', 'horror@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/horrorsoctudublin/", "label": null}, {"kind": "discord", "url": "https://discord.gg/BNPqSsNqKP", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "History", "body": "For the past few years we have been putting on weekly horror films of many different styles. Some are classics, others are more artsy and others are just straight up strange. Whatever kind of horror films you like, I''m sure we''ll show it.\n\nWe also take part in yearly trips to Nightmare Realm, and other horror attractions and film festivals. There is also Horror Gaming that we put on, we take reccomendations on what games to play, so feel free to give us your suggestions.\n\nIf you''re interested in the more supernatural side of the horror society, we also have you covered as we put on at least 1 séance a semester.\n\nWhatever interests you within the horror genre, I''m certain we have it covered."}, {"title": "Achievements", "body": "Awards won from the academic year 2023/2024\n\nBest New Society\n\nBest Photo\n\nBest Society Trip\n\nStudent Volunteering\n\nBest Christmas Appeal\n\nNominated for Best New Society and Best Photo at Board of Irish Clubs and Societies (BICS) 2023/2024\n\nChristmas Appeal Award 2025"}]'::jsonb, '3229', '2026-10-10T16:06:16Z', '["Arts"]'::jsonb),
  ('investors-and-entrepreneurs-society', 'Investors & Entrepreneurs Society', 'Investors & Entrepreneurs Soc', 'Business/Enterprise', 'Investors and Entrepreneurs (I&E) is a newly founded society at Technological University Dublin, created by Matthew Bailey and Harry…', 'Investors and Entrepreneurs (I&E) is a newly founded society at Technological University Dublin, created by Matthew Bailey and Harry O''Reilly. Through workshops, seminars, and networking events, I&E provides students with opportunities to explore business ideas and investment strategies. With a focus on innovation and collaboration, the society offers resources, mentorship, and real-world insights to equip members with the skills needed to thrive in the fast-paced world of entrepreneurship and investing. With many exciting activities planned and a strong nework of ambitious students, we invite you to become part of our community.', 'Rocket', 'amber', '', null, 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/unnamed_1708342002_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzI1NQ==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/investors&entrepreneurssociety', null, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '3255', '2026-10-10T16:06:15Z', '["Business"]'::jsonb),
  ('irish-sign-language-society', 'Irish Sign Language Society (Up for Adoption)', 'Irish Sign Language Society', 'Special Interest/Social', '', '', 'Globe2', 'emerald', '', null, null, 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzEyNA==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/irishsignlanguagesocietycitycampus', null, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '3124', '2026-10-10T16:06:14Z', '["Culture"]'::jsonb),
  ('islamic-society-city-campus', 'Islamic Society (City Campus)', 'Islamic Society (City)', 'Religious/Faith', 'The Islamic Society (ISoc) helps you stay connected to your deen (Religion) while having the best time of your life!', 'The Islamic Society (ISoc) helps you stay connected to your deen (Religion) while having the best time of your life! We organize a variety of exciting events every week for brothers and sisters, including Halaqas, Quran Halaqas , outdoor camps, and fun activities like go-karting, airsoft, Hikes, football, basketball, and more Indoor events!
Join us to make the most of your college life!.

Welcome to the Islamic Society (ISoc) of TU Dublin City Campus!

Our mission is to help students across the campus deepen their understanding of Islam and strengthen their connection with their Creator, all while ensuring they have the best time of their lives! ,We achieve this through a variety of engaging events and activities, including weekly Halaqas, Quran study sessions, outdoor camps across different counties, and exciting activities like go-karting, airsoft, hikes, ice skating, football, basketball, and much more. We also host indoor events such as Brothers and Sisters Games Nights, Brothers & Sisters Vibes Nights, FIFA tournaments, and a host of other exciting gatherings.

The ISoc offers a warm and welcoming environment, surrounded by great people. It’s a place where the bonds of brotherhood and sisterhood are strengthened, where the quality of university life is enhanced, and where we can all learn from each other in meaningful ways. Don’t hesitate to join us—it’s an experience that will be both enjoyable and enriching!

No matter your religion, ethnicity, or level of religious practice, you’re welcome to join us. We promise you’ll have a great time!

Enough talking—see you at our events!', 'HeartHandshake', 'teal', '', 'City', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/maingradientfadebd_1726609466_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/d9008ef3-0841-4aee-a40a-0fc7dfe971063_1724793506_th.jpg', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzA5Mg==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/islamicsocietycitycampus', 'islamic@socs.dit.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudcityisoc/", "label": null}, {"kind": "tiktok", "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@tudcityisoc", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "History", "body": "What did we Achieve in 23/24 ?\n\n• Airsoft\n\n• Go Karting\n\n• Go Quest\n\n• Weekly Halaqa\n\n• Weekly Football\n\n• Camps\n\n• Hikes\n\n• Games night\n\n• charity Bake sales\n\n• Dawn stalls\n\n• International Speakers"}, {"title": "Achievements", "body": "Here are some the achievements ISoc has made in the past few years:\n\n• 2014 Society Awards: ''Best Overall Society in TU Dublin CC''\n\n• 2014 Society Awards: ''Most Improved Overall in TU Dublin CC''\n\n• 2016 Society Awards: ''Best Society in SouthSide in TU Dublin CC''"}]'::jsonb, '3092', '2026-10-10T16:06:13Z', '["Culture", "Volunteering"]'::jsonb),
  ('islamic-society-tallaght-campus', 'Islamic Society (Tallaght Campus)', 'Islamic Society (Tallaght)', 'Religious/Faith', 'TU Dublin Tallaght Islamic Society aims to foster a positive environment for Muslim students on campus and to give them the opportunity to…', 'TU Dublin Tallaght Islamic Society aims to foster a positive environment for Muslim students on campus and to give them the opportunity to develop islamically (i.e. Halaqas), academically (i.e. Speakers and workshops) and socially (i.e. Dinner and get togethers).', 'HeartHandshake', 'teal', '', 'Tallaght', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/59837461_1035532439974740_3700082585695682560_o_1602590424_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/59837461_1035532439974740_3700082585695682560_o_1602590430_th.jpg', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzE5Nw==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/islamicsocietytallaghtcampus', 'islamic.tallaght@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudublinisoctc/", "label": null}, {"kind": "facebook", "url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/185876961605119/", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '3197', '2026-10-10T16:06:12Z', '["Culture", "Volunteering"]'::jsonb),
  ('korean-society-city-campus', 'Korean Society (City Campus)', 'Korean Society', 'Arts/Cultural/Languages', 'We are the TU Dublin Korean Society, a vibrant community passionate about promoting and sharing Korean culture.', 'We are the TU Dublin Korean Society, a vibrant community passionate about promoting and sharing Korean culture.

환영!

We are the TU Dublin Korean Society, a vibrant community passionate about promoting and sharing Korean culture.

Our society is dedicated to organizing a diverse array of exciting events throughout the year, each designed to immerse members and participants in the rich traditions, customs, and contemporary aspects of Korean life. Whether you''re interested in K-Pop, K-Dramas, traditional cuisine, language exchange, or learning about Korea''s history and heritage, we have something for everyone.

Join us to explore, experience, and celebrate all things Korean!', 'Globe2', 'coral', 'We will have meetings every week on Fridays!', 'City', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/bannerinsta_1696117352_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/KSocJPG_1726690707_th.jpg', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzE2Ng==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/koreansocietycitycampus', 'korean@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tud_korean_soc/", "label": null}, {"kind": "tiktok", "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@korean.society.tu", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '3166', '2026-10-10T16:06:11Z', '["Culture"]'::jsonb),
  ('latinos-society', 'Latinos Society', 'Latinos Society', 'Arts/Cultural/Languages', 'TU Dublin Latinos is an inclusive community that brings students together to celebrate Latin American cultures, make friends and share…', 'TU Dublin Latinos is an inclusive community that brings students together to celebrate Latin American cultures, make friends and share experiences. Through social and cultural events, music, food and more, we aim to create a welcoming space for everyone to connect, learn and feel part of the community. Everyone is welcome!

Welcome to TU Dublin Latinos!

TU Dublin Latinos is a welcoming and inclusive community created to bring students together through the celebration of Latin American cultures, traditions and experiences.

Our goal is to create a space where Latin American students can connect with one another, share their cultures and feel a sense of belonging, while also welcoming students from all nationalities and backgrounds who are interested in learning more about Latin America.

Throughout the academic year, we hope to organise a variety of social, cultural and educational events, including cultural nights, food-sharing events, music and dance activities, movie nights, games nights and opportunities to meet new people and make friends. We also aim to collaborate with other TU Dublin societies to celebrate the diversity of our university community.

Whether you are from Latin America, have a connection to the culture, or are simply curious to learn something new, you are more than welcome to join us!

Our society is about more than culture — it is about building friendships, sharing experiences, embracing diversity and creating a community where everyone feels included.

Come as you are, bring your culture, and find your people!', 'Globe2', 'coral', '', null, 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/TUDublin_1791539813_th.jpeg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzI4NQ==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/latinossociety', null, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "History", "body": "Our History\n\nThe idea of creating a Latin Society at TU Dublin first came to me Jhenifer, during my first year at TU Dublin. I noticed that there were societies representing other nationalities and cultures, but I couldn''t find one specifically for Latin American students. At the time, I wasn''t sure how to go about creating a society, so the idea remained in the back of my mind.\n\nAt the beginning of my second year, a Brazilian friend of mine An, also joined TU Dublin, and we started talking about how great it would be to have a society that brought Latin American students together. She shared the same enthusiasm, and that conversation inspired us to take the first steps towards making the idea a reality. I began researching how to establish a new society and reached out to other friends who were interested in joining the committee. Together, we decided to take the initiative and apply to create TU Dublin Latinos Society.\n\nOur main motivation is to connect Latin American students studying at TU Dublin and create opportunities for them to meet people with similar cultural backgrounds, share experiences and build meaningful friendships. Moving to a new country and making friends can be challenging, especially when you miss the familiarity of your own culture and the opportunity to connect with people from your home country or continent. We wanted to create a community where students could feel understood, welcomed and less alone.\n\nHowever, TU Dublin Latinos Society is not just for Latin American students, everyone is welcome! We also want to introduce students from other backgrounds to the richness and diversity of Latin American cultures, traditions, music, food and languages. We hope to inspire cultural exchange and perhaps even help people learn a few words and phrases in Portuguese and Spanish along the way."}]'::jsonb, '3285', '2026-10-10T16:06:10Z', '["Culture"]'::jsonb),
  ('law-society-city-campus', 'Law Society (City Campus)', 'Law Society', 'Political/Campaigning & Debating', 'Re-established in 2021, a society which was long dormant, the TU Dublin Law Society is dedicated to creating an innovative society which…', 'Re-established in 2021, a society which was long dormant, the TU Dublin Law Society is dedicated to creating an innovative society which provides the students of TU Dublin with a medium in all legal matters of interest. We intend to accomplish this by promoting the development of all student members in their legal vocation careers, increasing access to legal information, and representing our university in mock and moot competitions.

Our aims this year are to put on mixer events for our members, run moot courts, and collaborate with other TU Dublin societies as well as collaborate with law societies from other colleges. So if you fancy putting your legal knowledge to use (or just fancy having a bitta craic) we would be delighted to welcome you as a member of the Law Society!', 'Mic2', 'rose', '', 'City', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/logo_1722534161_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/455844801_1023054819521418_1605684357814903694_n_1724786357_th.jpg', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzIxMA==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/lawsocietycitycampus', 'law@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudublinlawsoc/", "label": null}, {"kind": "facebook", "url": "https://www.facebook.com/Tudublin-law-soc-10580938", "label": null}, {"kind": "linktree", "url": "http://linktr.ee/TUDUBLINLAW", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "Achievements", "body": "1st Place Intervarsity Law Summit Mock Trial 2024\n\nRunners Up Intervarsity Law Summit Mock Trial 2023"}]'::jsonb, '3210', '2026-10-10T16:06:08Z', '[]'::jsonb),
  ('lgbtq-plus-society-city-campus', 'LGBTQ+ Society (City Campus)', 'LGBTQ+ Society', 'Volunteering/Civic/Charity', 'Coffee mornings, workshops, game nights, advice and more fun events. We are here to support, educate and have fun with fellow queer people!', 'Coffee mornings, workshops, game nights, advice and more fun events. We are here to support, educate and have fun with fellow queer people!
Welcome to TU Dublin LGBTQ+ Society. We''re a social group that aims to provide a relaxed and fun environment for both members of the LGBTQ+ community, and allies alike. All are welcome!

Through a range of events, such as game nights, master-classes, guest speakers, and off-campus events, we aim to create a safe space for people to come together, and create a sense of community and belonging.

We also run a range of campaigns and information evenings, in a bid to provide both education and support to our members.

This year, we''ve planned a wide range of events to help curb your boredom - these include our famous coffee mornings, ice breakers like speed friending and karaoke and other fan favourite events such as niche PowerPoints, fan fiction readings and also collab events such as our annual trip to the Nightmare Realm with Horror Society', 'HeartHandshake', 'teal', 'Workshops · Guest Speaker · Classes · Gaming', 'City', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/LGBTQ1_1601659379_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/20201101_144937_0000_1604242314_th.png', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzEwMQ==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/lgbtqplussocietycitycampus', 'lgbt@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tud_lgbtq", "label": null}, {"kind": "tiktok", "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@tud_lgbtq", "label": null}, {"kind": "facebook", "url": "https://www.facebook.com/TUDublinLGBTQSociety", "label": null}, {"kind": "discord", "url": "https://discord.gg/SmTJH6SG", "label": null}, {"kind": "other", "url": "https://www.thequeerytudublin.com/", "label": "the queery | news"}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "History", "body": "The society originated, we think, in the old Kevin Street campus back in the early 1990''s back when we we''re known as DIT.\n\nOur society, as we know it today, is a conglomerate of multiple different LGBT societies that existed across the different DIT campus''s that merged together around 1999/2000.\n\nThe society has gone through many changes over the years, some of the different society branches back then were known as Gay & Lesbian Society in Kevin Street and the Cross Dressers society that existed in Bolton Street\n\nToday, we are the TUDublin LGBTQ+ (City Campus) Society and we are based primarily in the Grangegorman campuses of East Quad and Lower House"}, {"title": "Achievements", "body": "Awarded Best Charity/Civic society in TU Dublin City Campus (2019/2020)\n\nNominated for Best Charity/Civic society at Board of Irish Clubs and Societies (BICS) (2019/2020)\n\nAwarded Green Initiative Award at Board of Irish Clubs and Societies (BICS) (2021/2022)\n\nAwarded Mental Health Event Award at Board of Irish Clubs and Societies (BICS) (2021/2022)\n\nAwarded Best Small (On-site) Event In TU Dublin City Campus (2023/2024)"}, {"title": "Meetings", "body": "Workshops\n\nGuest Speaker\n\nClasses\n\nGaming"}]'::jsonb, '3101', '2026-10-10T16:06:08Z', '["Volunteering"]'::jsonb),
  ('live-music-city-campus', 'Live Music (City Campus)', 'Live Music', 'Performing Arts', 'We are a Society that is for anybody interested in Live Music and Music Production.', 'We are a Society that is for anybody interested in Live Music and Music Production. We host jam sessions Every Wednesday and occasionally gigs so don''t be afraid to come down!
The Live Music Society is a place for musicians, producers, graphic designers, videographers and photographers to collaborate, learn from each other, and overall improve abilities through cooperation and communication. A place to find that drummer your band was missing, or even to create a new band. We organise gigs and send a few opportunities to play to yous throughout the year!

