  ('mature-students-network', 'Mature Students Network', 'Mature Students Network', 'Special Interest/Social', 'The Mature Student Network gives mature students the opportunity to receive updates on events and activities open to them at TU Dublin.', 'The Mature Student Network gives mature students the opportunity to receive updates on events and activities open to them at TU Dublin.

We will circulate information to you on an ad hoc basis and please note there is funding available if you would like to organise events on campus for those engaged with the Mature Student Network and ready to take on a Lead Rep role.', 'HeartHandshake', 'emerald', '', null, 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/MatureStudentNetworkSticker_1789730438_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/MatureStudentNetworkSticker_1789730443_th.jpg', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzEwMw==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/maturestudentnetwork', 'claire.flannery@tudublin.ie', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '3103', '2026-10-10T16:06:05Z', '["Volunteering", "Wellbeing"]'::jsonb),
  ('media-society-tallaght-campus', 'Media Society (Tallaght Campus)', 'Media Society', 'Student Media', 'We are the TU Dublin Media Society! We are the Creative Centre of Societies on the Tallaght Campus.', 'We are the TU Dublin Media Society! We are the Creative Centre of Societies on the Tallaght Campus. If you have an interest in Photography, Videography, Films, TV, Graphic Design, Radio, Podcasts or if you just want to find a place to meet likeminded creatives, join the Media Society Today!

The Media Society aims to create a safe, inclusive space in which your creativity can be nurtured. We aim to provide a space where your ideas can be shared, built upon and come to life. Our main disciplines are in Photography, Videography, and Audio. We have loads events planned throughout the year, such as Photo Walks, Trips, Primitive Camera Creation, Podcasts, Short Films, Skit Videos, Workshops and many, many more to come! If you''re interested, then join the Media Society Today!', 'Camera', 'rose', 'Media Society hosts a range of events, such as: · Photography Events · Skit Video Events · Graphic Design Events · Radio/Podcast Events', 'Tallaght', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/MediaSocProfilePic1_1723414942_th.png', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/YouFoundanEasterEgg_1745282177_th.png', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzI2Mg==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/mediasociety', 'mediasoc@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudmediasociety/", "label": null}, {"kind": "tiktok", "url": "http://www.tiktok.com/@tudmediasociety", "label": null}, {"kind": "discord", "url": "https://discord.gg/ETyk8PGJyg", "label": null}, {"kind": "linktree", "url": "http://linktr.ee/tudmediasoc", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "History", "body": "The Media Society was founded in August 2024."}, {"title": "Achievements", "body": "TU Dublin Societies Awards 2025\n\nWinner - Best New Society\n\nWinner - Best Promotional Video\n\nNominated for Best New Society and Best Promotional Video at Board of Irish College Societies 2024/25.\n\nTU Dublin Societies Awards 2026\n\nWinner - Best New Society\n\nWinner - Best Promotional Video\n\nWinner - Best Event\n\nBoard of Irish College Societies 2025/26\n\nWinner - Best New Society (Small College)"}, {"title": "Meetings", "body": "Media Society hosts a range of events, such as:\n\nPhotography Events\n\nSkit Video Events\n\nGraphic Design Events\n\nRadio/Podcast Events\n\nLive Performance Events\n\nwith many more to come!"}]'::jsonb, '3262', '2026-10-10T16:06:04Z', '["Arts"]'::jsonb),
  ('nerd-society-tallaght-campus', 'Nerd Society (Tallaght Campus)', 'Nerd Society', 'Special Interest/Social', 'We are the Nerd Society based on the Tallaght Campus. We play D&D, meet up for Pokémon TCG, and have game nights every Thursday!', 'We are the Nerd Society based on the Tallaght Campus. We play D&D, meet up for Pokémon TCG, and have game nights every Thursday!

We are the Nerd Society, proudly based on the Tallaght Campus of TU Dublin. Our passion for games and all things nerdy brings us together, whether it’s playing Dungeons & Dragons (D&D), meeting up for Pokémon GO community days and TCG, or hosting Nintendays that feature a variety of exciting activities. But that’s just the start! We organize a multitude of fun events and gatherings to suit the tastes of all our members. Whether you''re into role-playing, strategy games, or casual meetups, there''s something here for you!

What is Nerd Society?!

At our core, we’re simply a group of nerds who love to share our interests. We regularly come together to enjoy a wide range of board games and video games, creating a friendly and fun environment for everyone involved. Beyond campus life, we also meet up for Pokémon GO events, taking the game into the real world to catch, battle, and trade with fellow enthusiasts. One of our biggest attractions is our Dungeons and Dragons campaigns, which we run in collaboration with our amazing sponsor, Underworld Gaming. Whether you''re a seasoned dungeon master or new to the game, our D&D sessions are a perfect place to unleash your imagination.

We have a few upcoming events soon! One of these is our long-anticipated Warhammer Kill Team sessions. These events will introduce players in how to construct figurines, paint and customise them and teach people how to play the game of Warhammer 40k! We also do social nights, looping in local sponsors for nerd trivia and fun activities!

