  ('new-voices-and-new-creatives-network', 'New Voices and New Creatives Network', 'New Voices and New Creatives…', 'Arts/Cultural/Languages', 'NEW VOICES & NEW CREATIVES is a brand new initiative - begun in Blanchardstown to allow musicians to perform on campus and vibrancy to the…', 'NEW VOICES & NEW CREATIVES is a brand new initiative - begun in Blanchardstown to allow musicians to perform on campus and vibrancy to the campus.
