  ('news-society', 'News Society', 'News Society', 'Student Media', 'News Soc is a course related society that focus on all things media and journalism.', 'News Soc is a course related society that focus on all things media and journalism. We run many different events such as trips to media outlets and hosting guest speakers. We have welcomed the likes of Dion Fanning and Sally Hayden as well as Paulie Doyle who recently gave a Freelancing 101 masterclass. We also regularly run workshops to teach you skills that will help you progress in the industry, covering things that are not necessarily covered in the media courses such as pitching to editors and invoice making. Other smaller events we have run include film and documentary screenings and an investigative journalism treasure hunt for charity!

Not only are we a platform for education, we are great craic! Part of the socs experience is making new friends and having fun so don''t worry about taking us to seriously, we all want to have a good time.

We are ALWAYS ready to welcome new members so regardless of what you are studying, if you have an interest in the media industry you should definitely join us and come see what we''re about.', 'Camera', 'rose', 'Workshops · Guest Speaker · Film Screenings', null, 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/NewsSoc_1601661571_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/image8_1601847673_th.png', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzEwOQ==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/newssocietycitycampus', 'news@socs.dit.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudublinccnewssoc/", "label": null}, {"kind": "facebook", "url": "https://www.facebook.com/ditnewssoc", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "Meetings", "body": "Workshops\n\nGuest Speaker\n\nFilm Screenings"}]'::jsonb, '3109', '2026-10-10T16:05:58Z', '["Arts"]'::jsonb),
