  ('operatic-society-city-campus', 'Operatic Society (City Campus)', 'Operatic Society', 'Performing Arts', 'Our Society is about all things Opera.', 'Our Society is about all things Opera. If you''re interested in drama, music, theatre workings, writing, literature, production, makeup, costume or design this is the place for you! We hold frequent masterclasses with experts from every aspect of the industry, put on fun activities based around opera and most importantly both attend and put on the highest quality concerts and productions we possibly can!', 'Music', 'plum', 'Recorded performances including collab with Irish National Opera · Workshops · Guest Speaker · Classes', 'City', null, 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzE2MQ==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/operaticsocietycitycampus', 'operatic@socs.dit.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudoperaticsociety/", "label": null}, {"kind": "facebook", "url": "https://www.facebook.com/DITOperatic", "label": null}, {"kind": "x", "url": "https://twitter.com/TUDOperatic", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "Meetings", "body": "Recorded performances including collab with Irish National Opera\n\nWorkshops\n\nGuest Speaker\n\nClasses"}]'::jsonb, '3161', '2026-10-10T16:05:57Z', '["Arts", "Music"]'::jsonb),
