  ('photo-society-city-campus', 'Photo Society (City Campus)', 'Photo Society', 'Student Media', 'Welcome to the TU Dublin Photo Society!', 'Welcome to the TU Dublin Photo Society! From seasoned- or semi-pro to absolute beginner, we aim to provide a supportive platform for members, and the resources necessary to showcase and develop their creativity through photography. Whether your passion lies in nature, fashion, food, lifestyle, portraits, fine-arts or anthying in between, Photo Soc hopes to give you the opportunity to develop your existing skills or take up an entirely new one! Through workshops, competitions, masterclasses with industry professionals, gallery exhibits and a plethora of other events, Photo Soc hopes to give you a varied and vibrant experience!', 'Camera', 'rose', 'Workshops · Guest Speaker · Classes · Exhibitions · Competitions · Workshops · Live Editing Sessions · Critiques & Discussions', 'City', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/logo1_1632311075_th.jpg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/banner1_1632311080_th.jpg', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzE0Nw==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/photosoccitycampus', 'photo@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudublinphotosoc/", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[{"title": "Meetings", "body": "Workshops\n\nGuest Speaker\n\nClasses\n\nExhibitions\n\nCompetitions\n\nWorkshops\n\nLive Editing Sessions\n\nCritiques & Discussions"}]'::jsonb, '3147', '2026-10-10T16:05:54Z', '["Arts"]'::jsonb),
