  ('public-speaking-and-debating-society', 'Public Speaking & Debating Society (City Campus)', 'Public Speaking & Debating Soc', 'Political/Campaigning & Debating', 'Public Speaking and Debate Workshops every week for everyone! Join us for debates/discussions on a wide range of interesting topics.', 'Public Speaking and Debate Workshops every week for everyone! Join us for debates/discussions on a wide range of interesting topics.

TU Dublin''s Debating Society - weekly discussions on current affairs

TU Dublin Debating Society: Solving the World''s Problems One Heated Discussion at a Time.

Do you have strong feelings about the state of the Luas? Have you ever lost sleep over a controversial take on pineapple pizza? Do you just love the sound of your own voice? You’ve found your tribe.

Join us every week where we tackle the big issues (climate change, social justice) and the not-so-big issues (is a cereal a soup? Discuss.). It’s the ultimate brain gym for overthinkers and under-talkers alike.

Reasons to Join (Besides Looking Incredibly Intellectual on Your Society Membership List):

· CV Buffing: Arm yourself with a superb set of life skills. Persuasion, confidence, and the ability to talk your way out of a parking ticket? Sorted.

· Allegedly Find Meaning: We can’t promise to solve your existential dread, but we can distract you from it with passionate debates and good company. (Results may vary).

· Travel & Triumph: Compete in intervarsity competitions across Ireland and beyond. See new cities, defeat other universities, and collect anecdotes for life.

· Socials, Obviously: Because what’s a well-constructed argument without a poorly constructed cocktail to follow?

No experience needed, just a healthy dose of curiosity (and maybe a tolerance for bad puns). All viewpoints welcome, except against fun. See you there!', 'Mic2', 'rose', '', 'City', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/IMG_0757_1756858186_th.jpeg', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/admin/uploads/images/organisation/profile/IMG_0757_1756858208_th.jpeg', 'https://mystudentlife.tudublin.ie/account/index.php?object=VXNlck9yZ2FuaXNhdGlvbk1lbWJlcg==&method=Zm9ybVZpZXc=&action=Nw==&systemClientID=Mg==&organisationID=MzIwMA==&actionType=YWRk', 'https://societies.tudublin.ie/societies/publicspeakinganddebatingsocietycitycampus', 'debating@societies.tudublin.ie', '[{"kind": "instagram", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/tudublindebating/", "label": null}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '3200', '2026-10-10T16:05:53Z', '[]'::jsonb),
