  ('stand-global-issues-course-2026', 'STAND Global Issues Course 2026', 'STAND Global Issues Course…', 'Volunteering/Civic/Charity', 'The STAND Global Issues Course at TU Dublin is an interactive, certified 5-week program open to all TU Dublin Students.', 'The STAND Global Issues Course at TU Dublin is an interactive, certified 5-week program open to all TU Dublin Students.
